---
/** One G1 elbow, three continuously operating feedback loops. Controller and
 * electrical/mechanical parameters are teaching values, not G1 specifications. */
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
const urdfUrl = `${baseUrl}models/g1/g1_29dof.urdf`;
---
<figure class="sc-demo" data-state="loading" data-urdf-url={urdfUrl}>
  <div class="sc-heading">
    <div><strong>三个环怎样一起抬起前臂？</strong><p>先抬起，再放上重物，观察前臂怎样回到目标位置。</p></div>
    <span class="sc-model-label">G1 左肘 · 教学模型</span>
  </div>
  <div class="sc-scene-meta">
    <div class="sc-angle-badge"><span>目标 <b data-target>0°</b></span><span>实际 <b data-angle>0.0°</b></span></div>
    <div class="sc-scene-note">上臂固定 · 角度从下垂起算</div>
  </div>
  <div class="sc-viewport" role="group" aria-label="G1 左臂：上臂固定，前臂绕肘关节转动；浅青色轮廓表示目标位置。可拖动旋转视角。">
    <div class="sc-loading" data-loading role="status" aria-live="polite"><span data-loading-message>正在加载 G1 左臂…</span><button type="button" class="sc-button" data-retry hidden>重新加载</button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="sc-view-tools"><span>拖动可换个角度观察</span><button type="button" class="sc-button" data-reset-view disabled>重置视角</button></div>
  <div class="sc-legend"><i></i> 实际前臂 <i class="sc-ghost-key"></i> 目标轮廓 <i class="sc-weight-key"></i> 重物</div>
  <div class="sc-controls" aria-label="机械臂演示操作">
    <button type="button" data-raise class="sc-button sc-primary" disabled>抬起前臂</button>
    <button type="button" data-weight class="sc-button" aria-pressed="false" disabled>放上重物</button>
    <button type="button" data-push class="sc-button" disabled>轻推一下</button>
    <span class="sc-controls-spacer"></span>
    <button type="button" data-pause class="sc-button" disabled>暂停</button>
    <button type="button" data-reset class="sc-button" disabled>复位</button>
  </div>
  <p class="sc-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-status>点击“抬起前臂”，把前臂从下垂抬到水平。</p>
  <div class="sc-cards" aria-label="三个控制环的分工">
    <section class="sc-card">
      <h4><span>1</span> 位置环</h4>
      <p>比较目标与实际角度，算出该转多快。</p>
      <div class="sc-card-values"><span>目标速度 <b data-speed-target>0.0°/s</b></span><small>实际 <span data-speed>0.0°/s</span></small></div>
    </section>
    <section class="sc-card">
      <h4><span>2</span> 速度环</h4>
      <p>比较目标与实际速度，算出需要多大电流。</p>
      <div class="sc-card-values"><span>目标电流 <b data-current-target>0.00 A</b></span><small>电流越大，电机出力越大</small></div>
    </section>
    <section class="sc-card">
      <h4><span>3</span> 电流环</h4>
      <p>比较目标与实际电流，调整绕组电压。</p>
      <div class="sc-card-values"><span>绕组电压 <b data-voltage>0.00 V</b></span><small>实际电流 <span data-current>0.00 A</span></small></div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <p class="sc-together">三个环持续共同工作。前臂停住后，电机仍要提供电流，才能抵抗重力。</p>
  <details class="sc-details">
    <summary>查看角度变化与模型说明</summary>
    <div class="sc-chart-heading"><strong>前臂是否回到目标？</strong><span>最近 6 秒 · 角度（°）</span></div>
    <svg class="sc-chart" viewBox="0 0 640 160" role="img" aria-label="最近六秒的目标角度与实际角度曲线">
      <line x1="42" y1="22" x2="620" y2="22" class="sc-grid"/><line x1="42" y1="78" x2="620" y2="78" class="sc-grid"/><line x1="42" y1="134" x2="620" y2="134" class="sc-grid"/>
      <text x="32" y="26" text-anchor="end">100</text><text x="32" y="82" text-anchor="end">50</text><text x="32" y="138" text-anchor="end">0</text>
      <path data-chart-target class="sc-chart-target" d=""/><path data-chart-actual class="sc-chart-actual" d=""/>
      <text x="42" y="157">6 秒前</text><text x="620" y="157" text-anchor="end">现在</text>
    </svg>
    <p class="sc-chart-key"><span>实线：实际角度</span><span>虚线：目标角度</span></p>
    <p>这里用 G1 左臂模型演示一个有重力的肘关节。位置环给出速度目标，速度环采用 PI 控制，电流环通过平均绕组电压调节电流；绕组电阻、电感和反电动势共同影响电流变化。速度环的积分作用让前臂在静止托物时仍能保持出力。</p>
    <p>G1 模型提供外形和关节运动关系；臂长、质量、负载和电气参数采用简化教学值。角度从图中的下垂姿态起算，不是接口里的关节坐标。此处展示三环级联，不代表所有驱动器都采用相同结构。</p>
  </details>
  <figcaption>观察重点：放上重物时，前臂略微下沉，控制器增加出力，随后回到目标附近。</figcaption>
</figure>

<script>
  import { createVisibleRaf } from '../lib/visible-raf.js';
  import { SERVO_ARM, createServoArmState, setServoPayload, pushServoArm, stepServoArm } from '../lib/servo-arm-model.js';

  document.querySelectorAll('.sc-demo').forEach((root) => {
    const demo = root as HTMLElement;
    if (demo.dataset.initialized) return;
    demo.dataset.initialized = 'true';
    const el = (name: string) => demo.querySelector('[data-' + name + ']') as HTMLElement;
    const button = (name: string) => el(name) as HTMLButtonElement;
    const viewport = demo.querySelector('.sc-viewport') as HTMLElement;
    const reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
    const deg = 180 / Math.PI;
    let state = createServoArmState();
    let history = [{ t: 0, angle: 0, target: 0 }];
    let running = false, paused = false, ready = false, disposed = false, loading = false;
    let last = 0, lastReadout = -1, lastSample = -1, actionAt = 0, action = 'initial';
    let armView: any = null;
    const urdfUrl = demo.dataset.urdfUrl || '';
    const details = demo.querySelector('details') as HTMLDetailsElement;

    const fixed = (n: number, digits = 1) => (Math.abs(n) < .5 * 10 ** -digits ? 0 : n).toFixed(digits);
    function updateChart() {
      if (!details.open) return;
      const start = state.time - 6;
      const points = history.filter(p => p.t >= start);
      const path = (field: string) => points.map((p, i) => `${i ? 'L' : 'M'}${(42 + (p.t - start) / 6 * 578).toFixed(1)},${(134 - p[field] * deg / 100 * 112).toFixed(1)}`).join(' ');
      el('chart-actual').setAttribute('d', path('angle'));
      el('chart-target').setAttribute('d', path('target'));
    }
    function controls() {
      button('raise').disabled = !ready || state.target > 0;
      const canAddWeight = state.target > 0 && Math.abs(state.angle - state.target) < .08 && Math.abs(state.speed) < .12;
      button('weight').disabled = !ready || (!state.payload && !canAddWeight);
      button('reset-view').disabled = !ready;
      button('push').disabled = !ready || state.target === 0;
      button('reset').disabled = !ready;
      button('pause').disabled = !ready || reduced.matches || (!running && !paused);
      button('pause').textContent = paused ? '继续' : '暂停';
      button('weight').textContent = state.payload ? '移除重物' : state.target > 0 && !canAddWeight ? '抬稳后放重物' : '放上重物';
      button('weight').setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(state.payload));
    }
    function readout() {
      el('target').textContent = fixed(state.target * deg, 0) + '°';
      el('angle').textContent = fixed(state.angle * deg) + '°';
      el('speed-target').textContent = fixed(state.targetSpeed * deg) + '°/s';
      el('speed').textContent = fixed(state.speed * deg) + '°/s';
      el('current-target').textContent = fixed(state.targetCurrent, 2) + ' A';
      el('current').textContent = fixed(state.current, 2) + ' A';
      el('voltage').textContent = fixed(state.voltage, 2) + ' V';
      // Readable state in the accessible name; live announcements are reserved for actions.
      viewport.setAttribute('aria-label', `G1 左肘教学演示：目标 ${fixed(state.target * deg, 0)} 度，实际 ${fixed(state.angle * deg)} 度，${state.payload ? '托着重物' : '空载'}。三个控制环持续共同工作。`);
      updateChart(); controls();
    }
    function draw() {
      if (!armView) return;
      armView.update({ angle: state.angle, target: state.target, payload: state.payload,
        pushing: state.time < state.pushUntil, effort: state.current / SERVO_ARM.currentLimit });
      armView.render();
    }
    function simulate(seconds: number) {
      const count = Math.ceil(seconds / .01), dt = seconds / count;
      for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
        stepServoArm(state, dt);
        if (state.time - lastSample >= 1 / 45) {
          history.push({ t: state.time, angle: state.angle, target: state.target });
          lastSample = state.time;
        }
      }
      while (history.length > 320) history.shift();
    }
    function settledText() {
      if (action === 'push') return '轻推后，前臂回到目标附近。反馈让控制器持续修正偏差。';
      return state.payload
        ? '前臂已经重新托稳重物。速度接近零，保持电流仍然大于零。'
        : '前臂停在目标附近。即使没有额外重物，也需要出力托住自身重量。';
    }
    function begin(kind: string, message: string) {
      action = kind; actionAt = state.time; last = 0; paused = false;
      el('status').textContent = message;
      if (reduced.matches) {
        simulate(5); running = false;
        el('status').textContent = '已按减少动态效果设置显示稳定结果。' + settledText();
        draw(); readout(); controls();
      } else {
        running = true; controls(); readout(); draw(); loop.start();
      }
    }
    const loop = createVisibleRaf(demo, { rootMargin: '80px', onEnter: () => { last = 0; void init(); } });
    loop.onFrame((now: number) => {
      if (!running) { draw(); return false; }
      // On return from another tab/offscreen, skip elapsed wall time instead of fast-forwarding.
      const dt = last && now - last < 200 ? Math.min((now - last) / 1000, .04) : 0;
      last = now;
      if (dt > 0) simulate(dt);
      draw();
      if (state.time - lastReadout > .09) { readout(); lastReadout = state.time; }
      if (state.time - actionAt > 4.5 && Math.abs(state.target - state.angle) < .0001 && Math.abs(state.speed) < .0002) {
        running = false; el('status').textContent = settledText(); controls(); readout(); return false;
      }
      return true;
    });

    button('raise').addEventListener('click', () => {
      state.target = SERVO_ARM.raisedAngle;
      begin('raise', '目标轮廓停在水平位置。三个环共同调整，让实际前臂跟上它。');
    });
    button('weight').addEventListener('click', () => {
      setServoPayload(state, !state.payload);
      begin('weight', state.payload ? '重物已经放上。留意前臂的轻微下沉，以及保持电流的增加。' : '重物已经移除。控制器会减小出力，让前臂继续保持水平。');
    });
    button('push').addEventListener('click', () => {
      pushServoArm(state); begin('push', '短暂向下轻推前臂。外力消失后，看看它怎样回到目标。');
    });
    button('pause').addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (running) { running = false; paused = true; loop.stop(); el('status').textContent = '演示已暂停，可以查看三个环当前的目标与反馈。'; }
      else { running = true; paused = false; last = 0; el('status').textContent = '继续观察前臂怎样回到目标。'; loop.start(); }
      readout(); controls();
    });
    button('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {
      loop.stop(); state = createServoArmState(); history = [{ t: 0, angle: 0, target: 0 }];
      lastSample = lastReadout = -1; last = 0; running = paused = false; action = 'initial';
      el('status').textContent = '点击“抬起前臂”，把前臂从下垂抬到水平。';
      armView?.resetCamera(); controls(); readout(); draw();
    });
    details.addEventListener('toggle', updateChart);
    const motionChange = () => {
      if (reduced.matches && (running || paused)) { loop.stop(); begin(action, el('status').textContent || ''); }
      controls();
    };
    reduced.addEventListener('change', motionChange);

    async function init() {
      if (loading || disposed || ready) return;
      loading = true; demo.dataset.state = 'loading';
      el('loading').hidden = false; el('retry').hidden = true;
      el('loading-message').textContent = '正在加载 G1 左臂…';
      try {
        const { createG1ArmView } = await import('../lib/g1-arm-view.js');
        if (disposed) return;
        const view = await createG1ArmView(viewport, { urdfUrl, onInvalidate: () => loop.schedule() });
        if (disposed) { view.dispose(); return; }
        armView = view;
        ready = true; demo.dataset.state = 'ready'; el('loading').hidden = true;
        controls(); readout(); loop.schedule();
      } catch (error) {
        if (disposed) return;
        demo.dataset.state = 'error';
        el('loading-message').textContent = 'G1 模型暂时未能加载，可以重试。下方仍可阅读三个环的分工。';
        el('retry').hidden = false;
        console.warn('G1 servo demo unavailable', error);
      } finally { loading = false; }
    }
    button('retry').addEventListener('click', () => { void init(); });
    button('reset-view').addEventListener('click', () => armView?.resetCamera());
    const dispose = () => {
      if (disposed) return;
      disposed = true; loop.dispose(); reduced.removeEventListener('change', motionChange);
      armView?.dispose(); armView = null;
    };
    document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', dispose, { once: true });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .sc-demo { --sc-accent: #158d99; margin: 1.7rem 0; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--sl-color-bg); }
  .sc-heading { display: flex; gap: .75rem; justify-content: space-between; align-items: start; margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  .sc-heading strong { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--sl-color-text); }
  .sc-heading p { margin: .3rem 0 0; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); line-height: 1.65; }
  .sc-model-label { padding: .2rem .5rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 100px; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); white-space: nowrap; }
  .sc-viewport { position: relative; overflow: hidden; height: 365px; border-radius: 10px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 45% 35%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-gray-6) 55%, var(--sl-color-bg)), var(--sl-color-gray-6)); }
  .sc-viewport :global(canvas) { display: block; position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .sc-loading { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center; padding: 1.5rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); background: var(--sl-color-gray-6); z-index: 3; font-size: .9rem; }
  .sc-loading[hidden], .sc-loading [hidden] { display: none; }
  .sc-loading { align-content: center; gap: .8rem; }
  .sc-view-tools { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: .5rem; margin-top: .45rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: .73rem; }
  .sc-view-tools .sc-button { min-height: 30px; padding: .25rem .5rem; font-size: .73rem; }
  .sc-scene-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; margin-bottom: .6rem; }
  .sc-angle-badge { display: flex; gap: 1.1rem; padding: .45rem .75rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 8px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-bg) 90%, transparent); color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: .8rem; }
  .sc-angle-badge b { margin-left: .25rem; color: var(--sl-color-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sc-legend { margin: .6rem 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .35rem; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .sc-legend i { display: inline-block; width: .65rem; height: .65rem; border-radius: 2px; background: #64768c; }
  .sc-legend i:not(:first-child) { margin-left: .55rem; }
  .sc-legend .sc-ghost-key { background: transparent; border: 1px solid #17a8b4; }
  .sc-legend .sc-weight-key { background: #efac46; }
  .sc-scene-note { color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: .7rem; }
  .sc-controls > *, .sc-angle-badge > *, .sc-legend > *, .sc-card-values > * { margin-top: 0; }
  .sc-controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .45rem; margin-top: .75rem; }
  .sc-controls-spacer { flex: 1; }
  .sc-button { appearance: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 36px; padding: .4rem .75rem; margin: 0; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); border-radius: 7px; font: inherit; font-size: .87rem; line-height: 1.4; background: var(--sl-color-bg); color: var(--sl-color-text); cursor: pointer; }
  .sc-button:hover:enabled { border-color: var(--sc-accent); }
  .sc-button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--sl-color-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .sc-button:disabled { opacity: .45; cursor: default; }
  .sc-primary, .sc-button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sc-accent) 12%, var(--sl-color-bg)); border-color: var(--sc-accent); }
  .sc-status { margin: .7rem 0; min-height: 2.9em; font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .sc-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .65rem; }
  .sc-card { margin: 0; padding: .75rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 9px; }
  .sc-card h4 { margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; font-size: .9rem; }
  .sc-card h4 > span { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 1.2rem; height: 1.2rem; border-radius: 50%; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sc-accent) 12%, var(--sl-color-bg)); color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); font-size: .7rem; }
  .sc-card p { margin: .55rem 0 .65rem; font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .sc-card-values { display: grid; gap: .3rem; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .sc-card-values b { display: inline-block; color: var(--sl-color-text); font-size: .9rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sc-card-values small { font-size: .8rem; }
  .sc-together { margin: .75rem 0 0; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .sc-details { margin-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); padding-top: .7rem; }
  .sc-details summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--sl-color-text); font-size: .83rem; }
  .sc-details p { font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .sc-chart-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; font-size: .75rem; margin-top: .85rem; }
  .sc-chart-heading span { color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .sc-chart { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: .5rem; }
  .sc-chart text { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: 11px; }
  .sc-grid { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-5); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sc-chart-target { fill: none; stroke: #159aa5; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .sc-chart-actual { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-text); stroke-width: 2; }
  .sc-chart-key { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin: 0; }
  .sc-demo figcaption { margin: .85rem 0 0; font-size: .77rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .sc-demo { padding: .7rem; } .sc-heading { flex-wrap: wrap; } .sc-model-label { font-size: .7rem; } .sc-viewport { height: 330px; } .sc-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sc-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr; gap: .2rem .6rem; } .sc-card h4 { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3; align-self: center; } .sc-card p { margin: 0; } .sc-card-values { grid-column: 2; } .sc-controls-spacer { display: none; } .sc-button { min-height: 40px; } .sc-status { min-height: 0; } }
</style>
